  "details": "Currently, some worlds have avatar height limits\n\nThese are variables which can only be edited by the world owner\n\nminimumHeight - The minimum avatar eye height\n\nmaximumHeight - The maximum avatar eye height\n\nalwaysEnforceHeight - If enabled, players who switch to use a very tall or very short avatar will automatically be set to \"minimumHeight\" or \"maximumHeight\"\n\nSometimes these are too restrictive. I'd be nice if groups could override these variables, either on a single instance or all instances of that group",
